01:36:36.500 --> 01:36:40.990
bytes per token over memory bandwidth

01:36:44.790 --> 01:36:47.579
is going to be equal to
the number of activated

01:36:49.599 --> 01:36:50.349
params over FLOPs.

01:36:54.020 --> 01:36:55.530
And then we're going to
solve for bytes per token.

01:37:18.350 --> 01:37:19.230
Batch size was missing here.

01:37:20.870 --> 01:37:23.410
It shows up here, and then it cancels
out by the time we get to here.

01:37:28.669 --> 01:37:31.390
