associated with this new token here.

01:40:30.100 --> 01:40:31.099
But this head, the

01:40:36.820 --> 01:40:36.830
128.

01:40:37.320 --> 01:40:37.629
Oh, sorry.

01:40:37.760 --> 01:40:39.500
This d-head is the
dimension of the vector.

01:40:39.660 --> 01:40:39.680
The

01:40:41.860 --> 01:40:46.000
