01:47:03.240 --> 01:47:06.440
And this is tcompute.

01:47:09.250 --> 01:47:09.389
And

01:47:12.210 --> 01:47:12.920
this is—

01:47:12.970 --> 01:47:13.430
That's decode.

01:47:13.490 --> 01:47:13.929
Decode.

01:47:13.940 --> 01:47:14.190
Right.

