01:48:16.400 --> 01:48:18.430
would be at 1, and this would be at 5.

01:48:18.660 --> 01:48:18.890
That's right.

01:48:20.020 --> 01:48:23.950
So it is, in fact, tremendously
memory bandwidth bottlenecked.

01:48:23.950 --> 01:48:25.480
The real graph looks something like

01:48:29.910 --> 01:48:30.250
that.

01:48:30.929 --> 01:48:32.250
It still crosses, but yeah.

